<title>USA: American Rice q4 shr profit $0.24 vs loss.</title>
<headline>American Rice q4 shr profit $0.24 vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.24     loss	 $0.72</p>
<p> Net profit		 2,305     loss	   278</p>
<p> Revs		     142,899		  115,574</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.88     loss	 $4.84</p>
