<p> Revs		     515,518		  393,775</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: All periods ended March 31.</p>
<p>Results for FY '96 include a $7.2 million reduction in carrying value of a property in Houston.</p>
<p>Per share results are after preferred stock dividend requirements of $1,483,000 in each quarter and $5,930,000 in each year. These dividends are cumulative, but have not been declared or paid.</p>
